# pgModeler Data Models
# 
# Save your .dbm files (pgModeler projects) in this folder.
# These files are XML-based and track well in git.
#
# Workflow:
# 1. Design your model in pgModeler
# 2. Save as .dbm file in this folder
# 3. Export SQL to sql/migrations/ folder
# 4. Commit both the .dbm and .sql files
